    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A pair of best friends recently became famous online. Both girls have their hair in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "double buns",
            "zh": "圆发髻"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They wear robes with crossed "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "collars",
            "ref": "v-collar"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", wide sleeves and long skirts. A lot of people come to visit and take pictures with them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "So, who are the two “besties”? They are "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "actually",
            "ref": "v-actually"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a pair of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "painted pottery figurines",
            "zh": "彩色陶俑"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " at the Luoyang Museum."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The figurines are more than 1,500 years old. They were found in the tomb of Yang Ji. He was an important leader from the Northern Wei dynasty (386–534). They are only 17 centimetres tall and appear to stand "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "side by side",
            "ref": "v-side-by-side"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They hold each other’s hands and seem to be saying, “Look! We are the best friends in the world!”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Shen Yu is a 25-year-old girl from Hangzhou. She and her best friend saw the figurines on social media and rushed to Luoyang "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "right away",
            "ref": "v-right-away"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". “There was a very long line of people waiting to see them. Everyone seemed very excited,” she said."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Shen and her friend liked the figurines’ traditional clothing and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "make-up",
            "ref": "v-make-up"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a lot. “We wear the same dresses as theirs, we have the same make-up, and we hold our hands like them. Then we take photos with them. That’s what true besties do!” she said."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "vocabulary": [
      {
